cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TRSpecAnalyzer: a MATLAB app for the analysis of time-resolved spectroscopy data"
abstract: "A single-file MATLAB app for analysing time-resolved spectroscopy data (transient absorption, time-resolved photoluminescence, time-resolved Raman and IR): corrections, single-wavelength fits, SVD, global and target analysis, lifetime density analysis, MCR-ALS and coherence analysis. Requires MATLAB R2020b or later and no additional toolboxes."
authors:
  - given-names: Woojae
    family-names: Kim
    affiliation: "Department of Chemistry, Yonsei University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8638-8744"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-21"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/woojae-collab/TRSpecAnalyzer"
keywords:
  - MATLAB
  - time-resolved spectroscopy
  - transient absorption
  - ultrafast spectroscopy
  - global analysis
  - target analysis
